ve Activities<\/b> like thumb painting, clay modelling etc, and storytelling are conducted on Sundays <br><br>\n&nbsp;<b>-<\/b> We engage with parents, teachers and the community regularly<br><br>\n&nbsp;<b>-<\/b> We also conduct <b>Quarterly<\/b> and <b>Annual Competitions<\/b> in every village for the children and the community<br><br>\n&nbsp;<b>-<\/b> Every month, a <b>Star of the Month <\/b>title is awarded to one girl and one boy in each village based on the maximum improvement shown by them on various life skill and non life skill parameters<br><\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-1f66c55 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"1f66c55\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-80dfc9c\" data-id=\"80dfc9c\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9cba760 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"9cba760\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-4bbe3b7 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"4bb